    {
      "Original": "On + Boost",
      "Context": "Localization..cctor (Config.NVIDIAReflexLowLatency.Option.OnBoost)",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "作者界面代码或本地化资源",
      "Translated": "开启并增强",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Off:\r\n     Standard rendering pipeline. May provide slightly\r\n     higher peak FPS, but higher system latency.\r\n     \r\nOn:\r\n     Optimizes system pipeline latency to align the CPU\r\n     and GPU, significantly reducing input lag.\r\n     Recommended for most players.\r\n     \r\nOn + Boost:\r\n     Further reduces latency by overriding GPU power-\r\n     saving features to force maximum clock speeds.\r\n     Increases GPU power draw and heat.",
      "Context": "Localization..cctor (Config.NVIDIAReflexLowLatency.HelpMessage)",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "作者界面代码或本地化资源",
      "Translated": "关闭：\r\n     使用标准渲染管线。最高帧率可能略高，\r\n     但系统延迟也更高。\r\n     \r\n开启：\r\n     协调 CPU 与 GPU 的处理时机，\r\n     显著降低输入延迟。\r\n     推荐大多数玩家使用。\r\n     \r\n开启并增强：\r\n     关闭 GPU 节能以维持最高时钟频率，\r\n     进一步降低延迟。\r\n     GPU 的耗电量与发热会增加。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
